Capsule Wardrobe – Project Plan
1. The Idea
An AI-powered personal styling app that helps users make the most of the clothes they already own by creating outfit combinations, encouraging rewear, and supporting smarter clothing decisions.
2. How It Works


1. Build your digital wardrobe
Upload photos of clothing. The app organizes them into a visual closet, starting with your Google Drive database.


2. Get personalized outfit suggestions
AI recommends outfits based on personal style, occasion, current trends, existing clothes, and automatically retrieved daily weather.


3. Rewear and rediscover
Find new ways to style existing pieces and identify clothes that are rarely worn through a Wardrobe Graveyard.


4. Shop more intentionally
Upload a potential purchase to see how it pairs with your wardrobe and whether it adds versatile outfit options.


5. Share and pack
Share wardrobes with friends, borrow clothing, and generate weather-aware holiday packing lists using clothes you own.


4. What I Want to Achieve

Generate personalized outfit combinations.
Track and encourage rewear.
Discover neglected clothes.
Explore potential purchases.
Share and borrow clothes.
Plan outfits and packing for holidays using automatically retrieved weather data.

5. Development Plan

Connect Google Drive and display the existing wardrobe.
Build the digital closet and clothing upload system.
Implement AI outfit generation and automatic weather integration.
Add rewear tracking and the Wardrobe Graveyard.
Develop smart shopping and holiday packing.
Add friend sharing and borrowing.
Test the app and refine the experience.
